The plate is square and about 350 px across. If it is a side plate of roughly 22 cm, the apple at about 128 px wide comes to roughly 8 cm in diameter. A medium apple of that size weighs about 180 g, and I estimate 52 kcal per 100 g.

There are also small residue smears and a tiny orange piece, perhaps carrot, at about 1 g.

